            <p class="section-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-1" data-i18n="shareSubtitle">Hər paylaşım Yusifin yaşama şansını artırır</p>
            <div class="share-buttons">
                <a class="share-btn whatsapp reveal reveal-delay-1" id="shareWhatsApp" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
